    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302100703/3021007030480"
  },
  {
    "id": 3021007030490,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "最後、ほんとに止めたのは\r\n円香先輩じゃなかった～？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302100703/3021007030490"
  },
  {
    "id": 3021007030500,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "どうせいつか終わるんだから、\r\nいつ終えたっていいでしょ～って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302100703/3021007030500"
  },
  {
    "id": 3021007030510,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……よく覚えてるね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302100703/3021007030510"
  },
  {
    "id": 3021007030520,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\nまあね～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302100703/3021007030520"
  },
  {
    "id": 3021007030530,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "この間も円香先輩が\r\n交換日記って言ってたから──",
